┌Help · arrows scroll · Esc close──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│busx · keyboard                                                               │
│                                                                              │
│t            new browsing tab                                                 │
│q            close current tab (last tab exits)                               │
│gt / gT      next / previous tab                                              │
│{number}gt   jump to tab number                                               │
│Tab / S-Tab  next / previous pane or form control                             │
│gg / G       first / last item or result line                                 │
│j / k        down / up                                                        │
│h / l        member categories · fold objects · actions                       │
│Enter        inspect · activate focused action                                │
│/            filter services, navigation, or members                          │
│r            refresh service/tree/property values                             │
│n            focus navigation (also on narrow screens)                        │
│c            copy command (choose a tool)                                     │
│y            copy result or watch text                                        │
│Esc          leave input · back to navigation · back                          │
│Ctrl-C       close current tab, including from inputs                         │
│                                                                              │
│Navigation: /App47 is an object; @ marks an interface.                        │
│Interface names retain their full namespace.                                  │
│Long names are clipped; the selected full name is above.                      │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
